<title>FRANCE: TABLE-CHRISTIAN DIOR FIRST HALF SALES UP.</title>
<headline>TABLE-CHRISTIAN DIOR FIRST HALF SALES UP.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French unless stated)</p>
<p>     Turnover				    22,176  vs  13,945</p>
<p>of which:</p>
<p>     LVMH					  21,591  vs  13,365</p>
<p>     Christian Dior couture		     626  vs     587</p>
<p>     Other				  loss     41  vs loss  7</p>
<p>NOTE - Christian Dior released the sales figure in a statement. Sales rose 59 percent versus the same period last year and by 9.2 percent on a like-for-like basis, it said. -- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
